sequenceDiagram
    participant App as "Application<br/>startup"
    participant Spring as "Spring Boot<br/>Environment"
    participant Props as "application.yml<br/>spring.data.redis / cache settings"
    participant Config as "erp-infrastructure<br/>RedisConfig"
    participant Bean as "RedisTemplate / RedisCacheManager<br/>(beans)"

    App->>Spring: start
    Spring->>Props: read redis properties
    Spring->>Config: instantiate RedisConfig bean
    Config->>Bean: create RedisTemplate and RedisCacheManager
    Note right of Bean: beans available for caching and templates
